 <h2>Bring the crew home.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Real magnets, stickers and plush toys of the crew, so your kid sees them every day. Tick what you want. We’ll tell you first when it’s ready.</p>\n      <form data-form=\"shop-waitlist\">\n        <div class=\"products\">\n          <label class=\"prod\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"want\" value=\"magnets\" checked><span><b>Fridge magnet set</b><small>All 6 characters plus a magnet habit board</small></span><span class=\"tagsoon\">FIRST UP</span></label>\n          <label class=\"prod\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"want\" value=\"stickers\"><span><b>Reward sticker sheets</b><small>A sticker for every habit they finish</small></span></label>\n          <label class=\"prod\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"want\" value=\"card-game\"><span><b>The crew card game</b><small>Play the habits as a family game</small></span></label>\n          <label class=\"prod\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"want\" value=\"plush\"><span><b>Plush crew</b><small>Starting with Dopa and Toci</small></span><span class=\"tagsoon\">LATER</span></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"lead-form\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Your email\" aria-label=\"Your email\" autocomplete=\"email\"><button class=\"btn btn-main\" type=\"submit\">Join the waitlist</button><span class=\"ok\">You’re on the list ✓</span></div>\n      </form>\n      <p class=\"fine\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">People on the list get first access and the launch price. Toys and paper only. Never anything for your kid’s body.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-foot\" id=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Little Brain Crew home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/assets/brand/lbc-logo-horizontal-white.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"48\"></a>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:340px\">The crew inside your kid’s brain, made sim